#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/04-interpolation-points.ipynb:9
msgid "Interpolation and evaluation points"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/04-interpolation-points.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"In this notebook we will discuss the use of interpolation and evaluation "
"points in PyBaMM. These points are used to control the solver and the output "
"of the simulation, and can be used to improve the performance of the solver, "
"or if they are used incorrectly, can lead to decreased performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/04-interpolation-points.ipynb:-1
